        <summary>This method is called when an AID conflict is detected during an NFC transaction.</summary>
        <remarks>
          <para>This method is called when an AID conflict is detected during an NFC transaction. This can happen when multiple services are registered for the same AID. If your service is registered for this AID you may want to instruct users to bring your app to the foreground and ensure you call setPreferredService(Activity,ComponentName) to ensure the transaction is routed to your service.</para>
